{
  "movie_id": 521200701,
  "subtitles": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "start_time": 6.1,
      "end_time": 10.5,
      "text": "...So this is how we parted ways with Master, huh"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start_time": 11.6,
      "end_time": 14.8,
      "text": "And the guild's still disbanded on top of that..."
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start_time": 17.2,
      "end_time": 19.1,
      "text": "Master..."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start_time": 19.6,
      "end_time": 21.6,
      "text": "DWAAAAAHHHH!!?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start_time": 24.3,
      "end_time": 26.5,
      "text": "Wh-What's going on now...!?"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start_time": 29.8,
      "end_time": 31.1,
      "text": "Master!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start_time": 32.2,
      "end_time": 36.6,
      "text": "Huh? What are the odds we'd run again in such a place!"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start_time": 37.0,
      "end_time": 42.4,
      "text": "What are YOU doing here, Master? And those monsters... where did they come from...?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start_time": 42.9,
      "end_time": 47.2,
      "text": "Well, that's exactly the mystery here~..."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start_time": 48.2,
      "end_time": 51.3,
      "text": "GUOOOOHHHHHHHHHH"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start_time": 52.6,
      "end_time": 58.3,
      "text": "...?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start_time": 62.9,
      "end_time": 66.3,
      "text": "...Turning a \"wall\" into completely different data like that..."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start_time": 66.6,
      "end_time": 70.5,
      "text": "Not even Vision Empress could pull off something like this..."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start_time": 71.2,
      "end_time": 72.2,
      "text": "...*sigh*"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start_time": 72.4,
      "end_time": 77.7,
      "text": "Honestly, I might not be able to crack this \"mystery\" on my own"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start_time": 78.4,
      "end_time": 84.3,
      "text": "So... yeah! I'm currently recruiting helpers! ...Or at least, that's the idea."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start_time": 92.0,
      "end_time": 93.7,
      "text": "Seriously... I guess we don't really have a choice, do we?"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start_time": 94.0,
      "end_time": 98.0,
      "text": "We'll help you out -- but what about the name?"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start_time": 98.2,
      "end_time": 99.4,
      "text": "Name?"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start_time": 99.6,
      "end_time": 104.1,
      "text": "If we're joining as members... that means you're reforming the guild, right?"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start_time": 104.3,
      "end_time": 107.8,
      "text": "And of course... it'll be \"Labyrinth\"! Right♪"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start_time": 110.4,
      "end_time": 113.2,
      "text": "Will you help us, Boy?"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start_time": 114.7,
      "end_time": 116.1,
      "text": "Of course!"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start_time": 118.5,
      "end_time": 122.0,
      "text": "Haha, I like that. In that case..."
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start_time": 124.6,
      "end_time": 129.5,
      "text": "As the very first mission of the newly-reborn \"Labyrinth\"..."
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start_time": 131.2,
      "end_time": 132.6,
      "text": "Let's go!"
    }
  ],
